ormal in 43 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Scurry County, the most of any pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, February to March came in at 6% of normal and November to December at 9%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 15416 at 31% of normal. The preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 15418 is 19.0.</p>"}
